[ti:Gas Fees (Night Drive)]
[ar:POISON FM]
[00:03.00]Night drive, neon on the dash
[00:08.75]Paying all these gas fees, burning through the cash
[00:14.50]City lights blinking like a pending tx
[00:20.25]Waiting on confirmation, what comes next
[00:26.00]Highway of blocks, eighty lanes wide
[00:31.75]Mempool full, but I'm cruising inside
[00:37.50]Gas fees, gas fees, worth every wei
[00:43.25]Midnight transfer, nothing in my way
[00:49.00]Low lights, synth line, engine humming low
[00:54.75]Every mile signed, every mile I own
[01:00.50]Gas fees, gas fees, let it all burn
[01:06.25]One more block and then we return
[01:12.00]Taillights fading into the chain
[01:17.75]Night drive, see you on the mainnet again
